    "preamble": "Sumathi P vs Palakkad Municipality on 28 January, 2026 Author: P.V.Kunhikrishnan Bench: P.V.Kunhikrishnan 2026:Ker:6994 Wp(C) No. 2333 Of 2025 1 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.V.Kunhikrishnan Wednesday, The 28Th Day Of January 2026 / 8Th Magha, 1947 Wp(C) No. 2333 Of 2025 Petitioner/S: Sumathi P Aged 52 Years D/O Late Pazhaniyappan Chettiyar Vaniyathara, Vengodi Post, Palakkad, Pin - 678622 By Adv Shri.U.Balagangadharan Respondent/S: 1 Palakkad Municipality Represented By Its Secretary, Municipal Office, Palakkad, Pin - 678001 2 The Secretary, Palakkad Municipality, Municipal Office Palakkad , Pin - 678001 3 The Principal Director, Local Self Govt. Department, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695001 4 The Secretary, Local Self Govt . Department Thiruvananthapuram ., Pin - 695001 By Adv Sri.Binoy Vasudevan Smt.Preetha Kk, Gp This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Come Up For Admission On 28.01.2026, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: Sumathi P vs Palakkad Municipality on 28 January, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/171000221/ 1 2026:Ker:6994 Wp(C) No. 2333 Of 2025 2 P.V. Kunhikrishnan, J. -------------------------------- W.P.(C.).No.2333 of 2025 ---------------------------------------------- Dated this the 28th day of January, 2026 Judgment",
